nxsut — reference supply-use database for the environmental impact analysis of
energy-transition technologies and energy policies, built from EXIOBASE Hybrid
v3.3.18 (Merciai & Schmidt 2021) with MARIO (https://github.com/it-is-me-mario/MARIO).

